  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nTo bring out the harmony of colours with an artistic touch, I chose to portray a version of the blue hour using green and red, perfectly complimenting one another. The cyan green adds the touch of artistry that also reflects the dynamic Dubai philosophy.\nThe recipe is best suited for twilight scenes, where the landscapes are cast with a blueish hue and illuminated by colored streetlights or glow of cars. It softens the red whilst enhancing the cyan green to achieve the perfect harmony and an artistic image.",
